              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>
    Formal proposition and proof, especially in <fr:link href="/dhsorens-lean/" title="The Lean Theorem Prover" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-lean/" display-uri="dhsorens-lean" type="local">Lean</fr:link> and <fr:link href="/dhsorens-rocq/" title="The Rocq Theorem Prover" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-rocq/" display-uri="dhsorens-rocq" type="local">Rocq</fr:link>, catch my attention from various angles. 
    This is my most recent research statement as a <fr:link href="/docs/sorensen-research-statement.pdf" type="external">PDF</fr:link>.
    <html:em>(Last updated 09/2025.)</html:em></html:p>
